    "SourceNote": "Imported 2026-08-17 from vendor/CarveraProfiles/CAM_Post_Processors/Freecad/Tools/bit/Makera_Carvera_M5_Threadmill_Plastic.fctb (Makera 'M5 Threadmill', plastic preset: 400 mm/min, 10000 RPM). HorizFeed is the TOOL-CENTRE feed for the thread helix (M5: centre orbits at r=0.5 mm; 400 mm/min at the tooth = 80 mm/min at the centre; 150 chosen for epoxy). Stepover = radial depth of the first thread pass; second pass to full radius. NeckLength 15 mm = usable thread depth. Teeth 2 mm from the tip, pitch 0.8."
